	//   - `RESET` or `RESTART`: Performs a warm reset of the virtual machine.
	//   - `SHUTDOWN`: Initiates a graceful shutdown of the emulator.
	//   - `TERMINATE`: Forcefully terminates the emulator process immediately without cleanup.
